# Decimal division preserves display precision

Divides 7 by 2 as decimals to verify that a fractional quotient is formatted
to the default two-decimal display scale, producing 3.50.

>>> source
dividend: decimal = 7
divisor: decimal = 2

decimal_quotient: decimal = dividend / divisor
print(decimal_quotient)

<<< stdout
3.50

<<< stderr
